+The full-record and April spectra (Supplementary Fig. 1b and Extended Data Fig. 1c) show sinusoidal power, the squared amplitude divided by two, after projection of segment offsets and before and after subtraction of the fitted whole template. Their thresholds are 99% quantiles of the maximum over 5–40 μHz from 200 resampled residual series (full record) and over 15–50 μHz from 1,000 series (April, together with pointwise 99% levels). No April frequency exceeds the latter threshold after tidal correction.
 
