@@ -8,56 +8,49 @@ A 1,550-nm carrier referenced to the Sr clock through a frequency comb in Shangh
 
 The 1,350-km link extends a 2,067-km dissemination system with bias-free noise compensation based on digital radio-frequency phase recording [12,24]. The out-of-loop round-trip signal and the optical phase-locked loops of the frequency chain are monitored continuously [12]; maintaining lock preserves the phase connection needed for coherent accumulation.
 
